      "x": 80,
      "y": 1682,
      "width": 588.0,
      "height": 122.5,
      "text": "the three flow diagrams carry the detail this one deliberately omits:\n   index-flow      the four size tiers, presigned upload, extraction\n   search-flow     the cache key, the ES query, the latency budget\n   document-flow   404-not-403, the primary-vs-replica read, retention\n\nnothing here is new  \u2014  every box and arrow already appears in one of\nthose three.  this is only the view that shows them all at once.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "the three flow diagrams carry the detail this one deliberately omits:\n   index-flow      the four size tiers, presigned upload, extraction\n   search-flow     the cache key, the ES query, the latency budget\n   document-flow   404-not-403, the primary-vs-replica read, retention\n\nnothing here is new  \u2014  every box and arrow already appears in one of\nthose three.  this is only the view that shows them all at once.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
